\sgaStableTarget{sga6.e09.cor.4-3}\textbf{Corollary 4.3.} Let $S$ be a noetherian scheme and let $G=\mathrm{GL}(n)_S$. Then the canonical homomorphism
\[
 K_\bullet(S)\longrightarrow K_\bullet(G)
\]
